    "Which verified interventions prevent the most welfare deterioration per unit of cost and operating burden?",
    "When do repeated case-level failures justify a local structural service?",
    "Which interventions improve coupled animal, human, public-safety, and ecological outcomes?",
    "Which pathways produce durable welfare-positive social integration?",
    "Can intervention additionality be supported rather than merely activity counted?"
